{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When a regular cat is dropped into a world of fantastical creatures and free-flowing magic, he must learn the arcane arts and become the ultimate wizard. To do that, he\u2019ll have to fight his way through endless hordes of adorable enemies. Use portals to hop between vibrant\u00a0 environments brimming with danger. Collect mystical runes and delve deeper into the arcane arts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176500/extras/steam_combat_new.gif?t=1744253650\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Spell Array For Every Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft spells by combining up to seven runes together for a near endless amount of spells. Hunt for synergies in Arcana and Power Shards which can be combined with spells to create big damage combos. Every rune is inscribed with their own unique meanings to create spells that are utterly unique. Like a real magic system, the spell engine interprets the player\u2019s incantation on the fly and creates the in-game code to power the spell, meaning that even the creators of the game can\u2019t predict what will happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you\u2019re the first to create a spell your name will be etched into the game\u2019s magic system - so experiment! Anyone who comes across your spell afterward will see you were the first wizard to venture into those mystical arts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176500/extras/craftflow.gif?t=1744253650\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>New Spell Engine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The spell engine behind Wizard Cats mimics real magic.\u00a0As a wizard you must wrestle the mystical arts to do your bidding. Use powerful runes to bend the world\u2019s magic to your will, but be careful sometimes it doesn\u2019t behave as expected. Only a true master of the arcane can adapt. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hold It Against You</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As players discover new spells so too does this unlock new spells for the world\u2019s enemy wizards. Mobs have access to the player compendium, meaning a spell you use against them could come back around. Enemies learn quickly, so you\u2019ll have to constantly adapt if you want to become the ultimate wizard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176500/extras/steam_holditagainstyou.gif?t=1744253650\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3176500?t=1744253650","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3176500?t=1744253650","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176500/93897365c8d7ccd2c305628370c21593547b69c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744253650","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176500/93897365c8d7ccd2c305628370c21593547b69c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744253650","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN US ON DISCORD</h1><p>","developers":["BigFrogg Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176500/f2da53814ab9cdc0e4ddedb09966b170d859b974/header.jpg?t=1744253650","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 BigFrogg Studios. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum